## 2. Core Product Features Implemented

1. **STITCH Career Intelligence Graph**: Signature visual network graph connecting candidate nodes (`RESUME`, `JOB TARGET`, `ATS DIAGNOSTIC`, `SKILL MATRIX`, `AI INTERVIEW`, `LEARNING ROADMAP`, `CAREER READINESS`).
2. **Deterministic Non-Fabrication AI Guardrails**: Resume tailoring compares suggested skills against verified candidate evidence and explicitly omits unverified experience (e.g. Docker, AWS) to prevent generative hallucination.
3. **Real-Time Voice Interview Simulator**: Fullscreen room with live voice telemetry (142 WPM, 2 fillers, 88% clarity, 83% confidence) and WebSocket streaming (`/ws/interviews/{id}`).
4. **Structured Resume Studio & ATS Diagnostic Console**: Interactive 3-zone document editor, ATS score ring (82/100), and actionable fix triggers.
5. **Learning Roadmap & Career Readiness**: Step-by-step career progression timeline that reactively recalculates readiness whenever candidate skills are verified.

