## 3. How to Run

```bash
# 1. Start FastAPI Backend (Port 8000)
cd server
python seed.py
python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000

# 2. Start Frontend Dev Server (Port 5173)
# In main project root
npm run dev -- --host 127.0.0.1 --port 5173
```
